      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Working Areas",
      "source_hash": 8832430179546896557,
      "context_hash": 17872374194895018194,
      "translation": "작업 영역",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:43:49.284977Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Much of the ongoing work and initiatives from the compiler team are performed by groups of people interested in specific areas of work.",
      "source_hash": 12363092609704179596,
      "context_hash": 12182299931829085037,
      "translation": "컴파일러 팀이 진행 중인 작업과 계획 중 상당수는 특정 작업 영역에 관심 있는 사람들로 구성된 그룹에 의해 수행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler team": "컴파일러 팀"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:43:49.284977Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "These groups are a great way for new contributors to get involved as they provide a stream of tasks focused around one area and have designated channels for help and advice.",
      "source_hash": 17043629632159138893,
      "context_hash": 2882808332225851975,
      "translation": "이러한 그룹은 하나의 영역에 초점을 맞춘 일련의 작업을 제공하고 도움과 조언을 위한 지정 채널을 갖추고 있어, 신규 기여자가 참여하기에 좋은 방법입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:43:49.284978Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Here is a list of areas where work is being carried on:",
      "source_hash": 11671339698368740808,
